<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>R.Cravings — Customized Cakes | Quezon City</title>
<meta name="description" content="R.Cravings — custom, made-to-order cakes in Quezon City. DTI registered. Round & heart cakes, custom flavors, and made-from-scratch designs." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,500;0,9..144,700;0,9..144,900;1,9..144,700&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  /* ===========================================================
     DESIGN TOKENS
     Palette: Cream #F5F0E3 · Ink #262A1C · Olive #6E7C3C
              Cobalt #1E3AA8 · Pink #FF6FA0 · Lime #D7DE6E · Burnt Orange #E4622A
     Display type: Fraunces (900, slightly wonky/soft) — matches the
     hand-tooled chunky lettering in R.Cravings' highlight covers.
     Body type: Nunito — rounded, friendly, easy to read.
     Signature: full-bleed color "stamp panels" that mirror the way
     R.Cravings already presents Menu / Flavors / Order Form as
     colored IG highlight cards — brought onto the web as sections.
     =========================================================== */
  :root{
    --cream:#F5F0E3;
    --cream-2:#EFE8D4;
    --ink:#262A1C;
    --olive:#6E7C3C;
    --olive-dark:#4E5A29;
    --cobalt:#1E3AA8;
    --cobalt-dark:#152A80;
    --pink:#FF6FA0;
    --pink-soft:#FFD9E8;
    --lime:#D7DE6E;
    --orange:#E4622A;
    --radius:22px;
    --radius-sm:12px;
    --shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(38,42,28,0.12);
    --maxw:1120px;
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }

  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,.display{
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
    font-weight:900;
    line-height:0.95;
    margin:0;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }

  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;}

  :focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--orange);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:0.14em;
    font-size:0.78rem;
  }

  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    padding:14px 26px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
    font-weight:800;
    font-size:0.95rem;
    border:2px solid transparent;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--orange); color:var(--cream);}
  .btn-primary:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(228,98,42,0.35);}
  .btn-outline{background:transparent; border-color:currentColor;}

  /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    background:rgba(245,240,227,0.9);
    backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(38,42,28,0.08);
    transition:box-shadow .2s ease;
  }
  header.scrolled{box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(38,42,28,0.08);}
  nav.wrap{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
    padding-top:14px; padding-bottom:14px;
  }
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:900; font-size:1.25rem;}
  .brand svg{width:42px; height:42px; flex-shrink:0;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:28px; align-items:center;}
  .nav-links a{font-weight:700; font-size:0.95rem; position:relative; padding:4px 0;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--orange);}
  .nav-cta{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;}
  .hamburger{display:none; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer; padding:8px;}
  .hamburger span{display:block; width:24px; height:3px; background:var(--ink); margin:5px 0; border-radius:2px;}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed; inset:64px 0 auto 0; background:var(--cream);
      flex-direction:column; padding:24px; gap:18px;
      transform:translateY(-120%); transition:transform .25s ease;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(38,42,28,0.1);
    }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    .hamburger{display:block;}
    .nav-cta .btn-outline{display:none;}
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{padding:80px 0 60px; position:relative; overflow:hidden;}
  .hero .wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:48px; align-items:center;}
  .hero-eyebrow{color:var(--olive-dark); margin-bottom:14px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); font-style:italic;}
  .hero h1 span{color:var(--orange); font-style:normal;}
  .hero p.lead{max-width:44ch; margin:20px 0 30px; font-size:1.08rem; color:#3c4030;}
  .hero-actions{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .hero-facts{
    margin-top:34px; display:flex; gap:26px; flex-wrap:wrap;
    font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--olive-dark);
  }
  .hero-facts div{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;}
  .hero-art{
    background:var(--olive);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    aspect-ratio:1/1;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    position:relative;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .hero-art svg{width:62%; height:62%;}
  .badge-tag{
    position:absolute; top:-16px; right:-16px;
    background:var(--orange); color:var(--cream);
    width:96px; height:96px; border-radius:50%;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:900; font-size:0.72rem;
    text-align:center; line-height:1.1; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    transform:rotate(8deg);
  }

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero-art{order:-1; max-width:340px; margin:0 auto;}
  }

  /* ---------- PANEL SECTIONS (the "stamp card" signature) ---------- */
  .panel{padding:88px 0;}
  .panel-head{max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 48px; text-align:center;}
  .panel-head h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,3.6rem); font-style:italic;}
  .panel-head p{margin-top:14px; font-size:1.02rem; opacity:0.85;}

  .panel-cream{background:var(--cream);}
  .panel-olive{background:var(--olive); color:var(--cream);}
  .panel-cobalt{background:var(--cobalt); color:var(--cream);}
  .panel-lime{background:var(--lime); color:var(--olive-dark);}
  .panel-pink{background:var(--pink); color:#5a1030;}

  /* ---------- FLAVORS ---------- */
  .flavor-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px;}
  .flavor-card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
    border-radius:var(--radius); padding:26px;
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;
  }
  .panel-cream .flavor-card{background:var(--cream-2); border-color:rgba(38,42,28,0.08);}
  .flavor-swatch{
    width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .flavor-swatch svg{width:60%; height:60%;}
  .flavor-card h3{font-size:1.35rem; font-style:italic;}
  .flavor-card p{font-size:0.92rem; margin:0; opacity:0.9;}
  @media (max-width:860px){ .flavor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} }
  @media (max-width:560px){ .flavor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- PRICING ---------- */
  .price-cols{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:32px;}
  .price-card{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius:var(--radius); padding:30px;
  }
  .panel-lime .price-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);}
  .price-card h3{font-size:1.6rem; font-style:italic; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .price-card .note{font-size:0.8rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; font-weight:800; opacity:0.75; margin-bottom:18px;}
  .price-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding:12px 16px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:8px;
    font-weight:800;
  }
  .price-row.hi{background:var(--pink); color:#5a1030;}
  .panel-cobalt .price-row.hi{background:var(--lime); color:var(--olive-dark);}
  .price-foot{margin-top:16px; font-size:0.82rem; opacity:0.75;}
  @media (max-width:760px){ .price-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- CUSTOM FLAVORS CALLOUT ---------- */
  .callout{
    max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--pink); color:#5a1030;
    border-radius:var(--radius); padding:36px; text-align:center;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .callout p{margin:0 0 14px; font-weight:700;}
  .callout .fine{font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; opacity:0.85;}

  /* ---------- ORDER FORM ---------- */
  .form-card{
    max-width:680px; margin:0 auto; background:var(--cream);
    border-radius:var(--radius); padding:40px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .form-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:18px;}
  .field{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:6px;}
  .field.full{grid-column:1/-1;}
  label{font-weight:800; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--olive-dark);}
  label .hint{font-weight:600; font-size:0.75rem; opacity:0.65; display:block;}
  input,select,textarea{
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-size:0.95rem;
    padding:12px 14px; border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    border:2px solid rgba(38,42,28,0.15); background:#fff; color:var(--ink);
  }
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:var(--orange); outline:none;}
  textarea{resize:vertical; min-height:80px;}
  .form-actions{margin-top:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .form-note{font-size:0.82rem; opacity:0.7;}
  @media (max-width:600px){ .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- FAQ ---------- */
  .faq-list{max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;}
  .faq-item{
    background:var(--cream-2); border-radius:var(--radius-sm);
    overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(38,42,28,0.08);
  }
  .faq-q{
    width:100%; text-align:left; background:none; border:none; cursor:pointer;
    padding:18px 22px; font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:1rem;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:12px; color:var(--ink);
  }
  .faq-q .icon{transition:transform .2s ease; font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--orange); flex-shrink:0;}
  .faq-item.open .icon{transform:rotate(45deg);}
  .faq-a{max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition:max-height .25s ease;}
  .faq-a p{margin:0 22px 18px; font-size:0.92rem; opacity:0.85;}

  /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
  footer{background:var(--ink); color:var(--cream); padding:64px 0 28px;}
  .footer-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap:40px;}
  .footer-brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-weight:900; font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .footer-brand svg{width:36px; height:36px;}
  footer h4{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.1em; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:800; color:var(--lime); margin-bottom:14px;}
  footer ul{list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--orange);}
  .footer-bottom{
    margin-top:48px; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(245,240,227,0.15);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;
    font-size:0.8rem; opacity:0.7;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:28px;} }

  .fade-in{animation:fadeIn .7s ease both;}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ SHARED LOGO (reused via <use>) ============ -->
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <symbol id="logo-mark" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="47" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/>
    <path id="circlePath" d="M50,10 a40,40 0 1,1 -0.1,0" fill="none"/>
    <text font-family="Nunito, sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="8.5" letter-spacing="2" fill="currentColor">
      <textPath href="#circlePath" startOffset="2%">R.CRAVINGS • QUEZON CITY • CUSTOM CAKES •</textPath>
    </text>
    <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M35 55 q15 -22 30 0 q3 14 -15 18 q-18 -4 -15 -18 Z"/>
      <path d="M38 55 v10 M62 55 v10 M45 60 v8 M55 60 v8"/>
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="1.6" fill="currentColor"/>
    </g>
  </symbol>
</svg>

<header id="site-header">
  <nav class="wrap">
    <a href="#top" class="brand" style="color:var(--orange)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><use href="#logo-mark"/></svg>
      R.Cravings
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#flavors">Flavors</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="#custom">Custom Orders</a>
      <a href="#order">Order Form</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQs</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a href="#order" class="btn btn-primary">Order a Cake</a>
      <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main id="top">

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="fade-in">
        <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Quezon City · DTI Registered</p>
        <h1>Cakes made<br>for <span>your</span><br>craving.</h1>
        <p class="lead">R.Cravings bakes fully customized cakes — round or heart-shaped, classic or custom flavor — made to order and ready for pickup every day from 11AM.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#order" class="btn btn-primary">Start an Order</a>
          <a href="#flavors" class="btn btn-outline">See Flavors</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-facts">
          <div>📍 San Bartolome, Quezon City</div>
          <div>🕚 Pickup from 11AM, open everyday</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art fade-in">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" stroke="var(--cream)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M50 120 h100 l-8 40 a10 10 0 0 1 -10 8 h-64 a10 10 0 0 1 -10 -8 Z"/>
          <path d="M55 120 v-25 a45 45 0 0 1 90 0 v25"/>
          <path d="M70 95 q10 -14 0 -26 M100 95 q10 -14 0 -26 M130 95 q10 -14 0 -26"/>
          <circle cx="100" cy="152" r="10"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="badge-tag">EST.<br>QUEZON<br>CITY</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ FLAVORS ============ -->
  <section class="panel panel-cream" id="flavors">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="panel-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--olive)">Flavors</p>
        <h2>Pick your cake's<br><em>personality.</em></h2>
        <p>Every cake starts as a soft chiffon base, layered by hand. Choose a classic or one of our signature flavors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flavor-grid">
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:var(--olive)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="var(--cream)" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Moist Chocolate</h3>
          <p>A rich, decadent chocolate lover's dream — moist chocolate cake layered with dark chocolate ganache, crunchy chocolate chips, and luscious chocolate mousse.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:var(--cobalt)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="var(--cream)" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Vanilla</h3>
          <p>Light, fluffy, and timeless — vanilla chiffon cake paired with smooth, airy vanilla chantilly.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:var(--pink)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="#5a1030" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Strawberry</h3>
          <p>Light, fruity, and refreshing — vanilla chiffon cake filled with luscious strawberry chantilly and bursts of real strawberry compote.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:#a8794a">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="var(--cream)" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Mocha</h3>
          <p>Soft coffee chiffon cake layered with dark chocolate ganache, crunchy chocolate chips, and creamy coffee mousse.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:#7B5CC4">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="var(--cream)" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Ube</h3>
          <p>A delightful twist on a Filipino favorite — ube chiffon cake filled with silky ube cream.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flavor-card">
          <div class="flavor-swatch" style="background:var(--lime)">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" stroke="var(--olive-dark)" stroke-width="3"><rect x="14" y="14" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/><path d="M14 26h36M14 38h36"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Biscoff</h3>
          <p>Fluffy cinnamon chiffon cake layered with luscious Biscoff whipped cream and gentle bits of crushed Biscoff biscuits for a subtle crunch.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PRICING ============ -->
  <section class="panel panel-cobalt" id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="panel-head" style="color:var(--cream)">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--lime)">Pricing</p>
        <h2>Starting prices,<br><em>by size.</em></h2>
        <p style="opacity:0.85">Final price may vary depending on the requested design.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="price-cols">
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Round Cakes</h3>
          <p class="note">Starting price</p>
          <div class="price-row"><span>Bento</span><span>₱300</span></div>
          <div class="price-row hi"><span>4 × 4</span><span>₱550</span></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>6 × 2.5</span><span>₱800</span></div>
          <div class="price-row hi"><span>6 × 4</span><span>₱1,000</span></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>7 × 4</span><span>₱1,300</span></div>
          <div class="price-row hi"><span>8 × 4</span><span>₱1,600</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="price-card">
          <h3>Heart Cakes</h3>
          <p class="note">Starting price</p>
          <div class="price-row"><span>6 × 4</span><span>₱1,070</span></div>
          <div class="price-row hi"><span>7 × 4</span><span>₱1,400</span></div>
          <div class="price-row"><span>8 × 4</span><span>₱1,750</span></div>
          <p class="price-foot">Prices shown are starting points — send us your design idea for an exact quote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CUSTOM FLAVORS CALLOUT ============ -->
  <section class="panel panel-lime" id="custom">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="panel-head" style="color:var(--olive-dark)">
        <p class="eyebrow">Custom Flavors</p>
        <h2>Have something<br><em>specific in mind?</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <p>Our team is made up of culinary-trained bakers, so your cake is in expert hands. We offer custom flavors on request — available for cakes 8×5 inches and up, or for tiered cakes.</p>
        <p class="fine">Custom flavor orders must be placed at least 2–3 weeks before your delivery date. Pricing may vary depending on the complexity of the flavor or cost of ingredients.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ORDER FORM ============ -->
  <section class="panel panel-pink" id="order">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="panel-head" style="color:#5a1030">
        <p class="eyebrow">Order Form</p>
        <h2>Let's build<br><em>your cake.</em></h2>
        <p>Fill this out and it'll open a ready-to-send message — we'll follow up with a quote.</p>
      </div>

      <form class="form-card" id="orderForm">
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="fullName">Full name</label>
            <input id="fullName" name="fullName" type="text" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="username">Account username</label>
            <input id="username" name="username" type="text" placeholder="Instagram / Facebook">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="contact">Contact number</label>
            <input id="contact" name="contact" type="tel" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="size">Size</label>
            <select id="size" name="size" required>
              <option value="">Select a size</option>
              <optgroup label="Round Cakes">
                <option>Bento — ₱300</option>
                <option>4×4 — ₱550</option>
                <option>6×2.5 — ₱800</option>
                <option>6×4 — ₱1,000</option>
                <option>7×4 — ₱1,300</option>
                <option>8×4 — ₱1,600</option>
              </optgroup>
              <optgroup label="Heart Cakes">
                <option>6×4 — ₱1,070</option>
                <option>7×4 — ₱1,400</option>
                <option>8×4 — ₱1,750</option>
              </optgroup>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="flavor">Flavor</label>
            <select id="flavor" name="flavor" required>
              <option value="">Select a flavor</option>
              <option>Moist Chocolate</option>
              <option>Vanilla</option>
              <option>Strawberry</option>
              <option>Mocha</option>
              <option>Ube</option>
              <option>Biscoff</option>
              <option>Custom flavor (please describe below)</option>
