        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">What payment methods do you accept? <span class="icon">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>We accept GCash, BPI, and SeaBank.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">Where are you located? <span class="icon">+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>We're based in San Bartolome, Quezon City. All orders are for pickup.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

